  "about": [
    "Containers of ours whose chunk number is named somewhere: by Lua, a build tool, a",
    "shader library name or the launcher itself. Every other container the launcher",
    "mounts takes a local number from 10000 up when it is written into Paks, with its",
    "shader library renamed to match (docs/chunk_numbering.md). These keep the number",
    "they were cooked with. A container matches an entry when its cached name starts",
    "pakchunk<number>-<name> and the next character is '-', '_' or nothing.",
    "No two entries share a name, and no two entries with a shader library share a",
    "number: the launcher's tests fail on either (chunk_numbers.rs)."
